                                                "sense_id": "3f7e87a3-f3ba-36a0-b92b-4351dc9eed9c",
                                                "text": "Ahead of them a group of mandibulous sales men had set up their combustion cups and incendiary ratchets to demonstrate their wares to whatever officers might come by."
